15px\">日</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"> </span></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"line-height:40px;font-weight:bolder;background:cornsilk;color:crimson;border:1px solid crimson;font-size:14px;text-align: center;width: 90%;margin: 10px auto\">依法必须招标的工程项目的公告信息以其法定媒体发布的为准。</p>", "method": "非政府采购", "region": "河南", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [], "hasAttachment": false, "is_bidding": true}